Hey, folks! We`re in halloween’s month, so, to celebrate it, we brought you an sexy and chilling update to you!

[b]This update will give you an improved gameplay and more:[/b]

[list]
[*] Halloween`s theme;
[*] Graphic and GUI improvement;
[*] Animations;
[*] Cutscenes; 
[*] Audio effects upgrades;
[*] VFX refines;
[*] New Pause Menu;
[*] Best Personal score update;
[*] Difficulty levels rebalancing;
[*] Better achievements allocation,
[/list]

And you still have [b]a brand new game mode[/b] with a challenging character who claims its too self-sufficient. Watch out or she`ll freeze you!
